+   "source": [
+    "## Simulation parameters\n",
+    "\n",
+    "We use a shared integration time step of `dt = 0.1` ms throughout.\n",
+    "We will run for **1000 ms** — long enough to see JansenRit alpha-band\n",
+    "oscillations settle into a steady rhythm."
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "code",
